         {
          "author": "dario",
          "minute": "14:14",
          "text": "that was the call, yeah. and its gone. the 0.0 clamp comes out of free_capacity \u2014 forgiving the overshoot is exactly what let a light estimator run past the provider ceiling three windows straight"
         },
         {
          "author": "dermot",
          "minute": "14:16",
          "text": "so it goes negative now"
         },
         {
          "author": "dario",
          "minute": "14:17",
          "text": "it goes negative now. you carry the debt into the next window instead of pretending nothing happend"
